OL,3,GNEWSAAntibiotics saved my life - then  
OL,4,Anearly killed me                       
OL,6,FHolidaymaker Harriet Davies was left   
OL,7,Ffighting for her life after suffering  
OL,8,Fside effects from drugs she believed   
OL,9,Fwould help her.                        
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old fell ill with          
OL,12,Fappendicitis while skiing in France in 
OL,13,FJanuary.                               
OL,15,FAfter having surgery and being given   
OL,16,Fmedication there Davies, from Cardiff, 
OL,17,Freturned home. But the pain persisted. 
OL,19,FOn returning to hospital, a scan       
OL,20,Frevealed an abscess in her abdomen and 
OL,21,Fshe was given antibiotics.             
